## Behavior

- Smallest correct diff; match existing patterns — prefer shells in `05-components.mdc` before new components
- **Skills first:** before scaffolding (page, leaf, schema, API, SEO, deploy), **read** the matching `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` and follow it
- Urdu UI only → `npm run check:urdu` after UI changes; layout/type/responsive → `rtl-check` (375 · 768 · 1440)
- Commit/push only when user asks; never commit secrets
- Ship check → `preflight` skill (`lint` + `check:urdu` + `test` + `build` if deploy)
- Do not invent parallel frameworks, design systems, or folders outside `14-file-structure.mdc`
- Ops skills (`deploy`, `fix-chunk-mime`, `upgrade-deps`, `setup-revalidation`) — only when the user asks or a skill is named
